  "_note": "NOTE: the Sorofy engine reads the built wasm from <source root>/target and runs `cargo fetch` at the source root, so it can only reproduce a contract whose workspace IS the source root. contracts/ is therefore built as its own tree (a standalone repository would be the natural home). The engine reads build output from a fixed path and does not pass --manifest-path to `cargo fetch`; see HACKATHON.md. The registry was built the same way as the token: contracts/ as the source root, --package selecting one contract, in the pinned image. Both registry instances hold identical on-chain bytes (checked with `stellar contract fetch`)."
